{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/7c125c82d398b4a254c29e69c3c18f45.poster.avif?t=1772335722\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/7c125c82d398b4a254c29e69c3c18f45.webm?t=1772335722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/7c125c82d398b4a254c29e69c3c18f45.mp4?t=1772335722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise. Multiply. Then roll them all at once. A fast-paced dice deckbuilding roguelike.   </strong><br> <br> Arrange dice whose faces are composed of abilities on the board, then roll them all simultaneously in turn-based battles.<br>Combat and events alike are decided by the roll. \u2014 Let\u2019s begin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Simultaneous Roll System</strong><br>Choose whether to convert dice in your hand into mana or pay their cost to play them onto the board.<br> Attack, defense, and buff dice on the field are rolled all at once.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/9377d8122083daefc11c279682e6c957.poster.avif?t=1772335722\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/9377d8122083daefc11c279682e6c957.webm?t=1772335722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/9377d8122083daefc11c279682e6c957.mp4?t=1772335722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Dice Customization</strong><br>One-time enchantments that dramatically alter a die\u2019s performance,<br>  as well as events such as duplication and fusion, refine and shape your build.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.poster.avif?t=1772335722\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.webm?t=1772335722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.mp4?t=1772335722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Adventure Variety</strong> <br>- 4 characters, each with unique skills and relics    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 150+ dice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 40+ enchantments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 60+ relics   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These combinations create a different build every run.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3298780?t=1772335722","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3298780?t=1772335722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/e7d1074e115c37cd03d8f6d4a7f502b982d8c4c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772335722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/e7d1074e115c37cd03d8f6d4a7f502b982d8c4c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772335722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3669800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p