ine and shape your build.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.poster.avif?t=1772335722\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.webm?t=1772335722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.mp4?t=1772335722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Adventure Variety</strong> <br>- 4 characters, each with unique skills and relics    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 150+ dice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 40+ enchantments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 60+ relics   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These combinations create a different build every run.</p>","developers":["Ginnungames"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/866f5b5ff5a1cc1ca36d529a5cb74cd9e171f02d/header.jpg?t=1772335722","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina or later (Intel or Apple Silicon)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (6th gen or later) / Apple M1 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/32